# AD_HOC workspace meeting process

This workspace is optimized to avoid re-reviewing transcripts and re-running BMAD prep.

## Folder roles

- `AD_HOC/workspace/meeting/transcripts/` — transcript inbox (unreviewed)
- `AD_HOC/workspace/meeting/transcript-summaries/` — first-pass summaries from transcripts
- `AD_HOC/workspace/meeting/transcript_done/` — reviewed transcripts (moved out of inbox)
- `AD_HOC/workspace/meeting/archive-summaries/` — summaries that were used for BMAD prep (archived)

## Default behavior

- When asked to summarize a transcript file from `transcripts/`, write the summary to `transcript-summaries/` and move the transcript to `transcript_done/`.
- When asked for “BMAD ingest formatting” or BMAD prep output, write it to `archive-summaries/` and move any consumed source summaries there too.

